**27.8. Clausen's Integral and Related Summations**

**27.8.1**

\(f(\theta)\!=\!-\!\int_{0}^{\theta}\ln\left(2\sin\frac{t}{2}\right)dt\!\!=\!\! \sum\limits_{k=1}^{\infty}\frac{\sin k\theta}{k^{2}}\) (\(0\!\leq\!\theta\!\leq\!\pi\))

**Series Representation**

**27.8.2**

